2026-10-15 — QA review fixes, GreenFin upstream reconciliation and mobile layout

- Ran a four-role functional review against local D1/R2 and compared GreenFin rules with stoy95536/GreenFin. Findings and the comparison table are kept outside the repository in the QA report.
- Bank GreenFin cases now pick the newest indicator and Data Health row per type (previously the oldest). Recalculation removes experience left by deactivated actions, matching upstream recalculation.
- Evidence First: green actions require at least one owned, valid, verified, non-V0 evidence record; actions without evidence are treated as V0 (0 XP). This intentionally differs from upstream, which grants V1 (50%). Farmer form gained an evidence picker; legacy no-evidence actions are labelled as not recognised.
- Dimension cap of 250 now applies per calendar year of the action date; total cap of 1000 unchanged.
- Experience level labels reverted to upstream names (尚未建立／萌芽／成長／穩健／領航／示範).
- Consumer invoice verification now creates a pending action submission reviewed by the admin before points are granted; admin test runs grant no points. Duplicate invoice protection unchanged.
- Recorded the real actor as reviewer, rejected unknown system parameters, guarded concurrent project support writes, added frame/sniff/referrer/HSTS response headers, and blocked registration for ended activities.
- Display: real receipt dates and numbers, computed farmer order/traceability metrics, Chinese labels for indicators, scopes and ledger sources, UTC-to-Taiwan time display, Taiwan-day defaults and authorization day boundaries, manually corrected OCR fields no longer flagged as low confidence, farmer names in fulfilment, no duplicated page titles.
- Mobile: styled the GreenFin sub-navigation, added automatic horizontal-scroll hints (visible scrollbar and edge fade), admin mobile logout, fixed counter wrapping and account ID clipping, stacked the order layout below 1180px.
- Not changed by request: outcome reports remain routed to institution-001; admin order-change review for non-demo farmers unchanged.

Gate: verified locally; see logs/test-results/2026-10-15-qa-review-fixes.txt.

- Deployed Worker 59f8380b-0a36-47a8-956c-446e9af9d9cd to production from PR #2 (previous fb5136ee). No remote D1 migration. Public production smoke checks recorded in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md; signed-in production flows not verified by the agent.

